{
  "abstract": "We present a clean, non-circular formulation of Modal Triplet Theory (MTT): a conditional framework governing when stable reduced descriptions exist, how they relate, and why no global reduced description is possible. The theory is formulated abstractly in terms of projection, admissibility, and contractive induced dynamics, with explicit realizations treated as non-axiomatic instantiations.",
